  "version": 1,
  "metadata": {
    "title": "Back-and-change empties a visited block",
    "description": "§3/§4/§6: after back, a change makes an already answered block empty: its values are cleared, it is skipped on next and on back, a later required question becomes relevant, and the block returns empty when relevant again.",
